{"author":"did:key:z6Mkmz8SWiUshwDMszSqwzMngt7ScNmsEj7vZoFRLjpcZTm9","evaluation":{"digest":{"sha256":"21c2a61f4e8372fe6ac82644219accfa5d014a789ad96fc80da0a780daccdd93"}},"instructions":"Return exactly ACCEPT or REJECT.","network.jinn.binary-judgment.item-sha256":"sha256:6df201a9827b9b1193b987e6fc8cffa26092a206235940ff15282888969cc5cd","outputs":[{"mediaType":"text/plain; charset=utf-8","name":"judge-response","required":true},{"mediaType":"application/vnd.jinn.binary-judgment.observation.v1+json","name":"judge-observation","required":true},{"mediaType":"application/vnd.inspect-ai.eval-log+json","name":"inspect-log","required":false}],"payload":{"candidateAnswer":"A cookout at the community center where veterans could meet local employers and access resources.","evidence":"[D15:13 | 7:38 pm on 20 May, 2023] John: Thanks, Maria! We had a great time throwing a small party and inviting some veterans to share their stories. It was awesome seeing them make connections and find camaraderie. All the smiles and new friendships made it really heartwarming.","itemId":"urn:uuid:ffbb69fd-9d51-55f6-84ed-405306af278c","provenance":{"sourceCommitment":"sha256:adbbada03ccae58c5f522bb091b3ac58367a1e16aea6ac46a90a22c491fafad9","timestamp":"2026-04-02T14:22:55Z"},"question":"What did John host for the veterans in May 2023 as part of the project?","referenceAnswer":"a small party to share their stories","sources":[{"digest":{"sha256":"adbbada03ccae58c5f522bb091b3ac58367a1e16aea6ac46a90a22c491fafad9"}}]},"profile":{"digest":{"sha256":"ebb34d8362e2cc3135847a5ad6f3ee3d9c2d9922a2b827aa9dfcbaf440b22557"},"uri":"https://spec.jinn.network/task-profiles/binary-judgment/2.0"},"protocol":"https://spec.jinn.network/profiles/task-execution/v1"}